<div class="hp" style="padding-left:300px">
<div class="lb gy" style="color:#ffd21a">Mission active // Porto, Portugal</div>
<h1 class="h crt hh" style="font-size:96px;margin-top:22px"><span class="gy">Breach.</span><br>Analyse.<br><span class="gc">Harden.</span></h1>
</div>
<div>
